{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8124", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8124", "text": "'No motion was recorded alongside the heart rate.'", "sha256": "5551e86f12538a9ba2ddd8fadd50ff08f8b55058896c5ea1b14e89a2b1bfd38c", "kind": "dart", "start": 8124, "end": 8174, "line": 202}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8407", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8407", "text": "'This day came from an imported export, which carries the night only — '\n'nothing was recorded for the waking day, and there is no raw behind '\n'it to work one out from.'", "sha256": "71f2fe79d8762561f46593a91671a309609b0e2ffce8260785a8aa88c488b4f1", "kind": "dart", "start": 8407, "end": 8597, "line": 207}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8625", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8625", "text": "'Today has not produced any activity to read yet — nothing has reached '\n'the app for it.'", "sha256": "012edefbf84fd53dac714e41b35578d356324d549d9a99013485ad43c7061798", "kind": "dart", "start": 8625, "end": 8725, "line": 211}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8740", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8740", "text": "'That night has no total sleep time behind it.'", "sha256": "8c24f3dee42eb9679851b7956de7ddc201c673a17aedfaef9a2db6f45383f7cb", "kind": "dart", "start": 8740, "end": 8787, "line": 213}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8804", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8804", "text": "'That night has no wake time behind it.'", "sha256": "3aa4e4e37cd4d2c883a1905e26bc9f77d243ab356c9fecee1664ace0df4506b1", "kind": "dart", "start": 8804, "end": 8844, "line": 214}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8862", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8862", "text": "'That night has no sleep efficiency behind it.'", "sha256": "d9db717f77c0a52adbb785eeb74a55079c66d767a77b1fce74719e20cc3e3432", "kind": "dart", "start": 8862, "end": 8909, "line": 215}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-8939", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-8939", "text": "'The band has not yet held a high enough heart rate through a hard '\n'effort to measure a ceiling from.'", "sha256": "388dbfe469ec79a091ff774e11272048b48845cd79eeab148eb3ca971bf11b18", "kind": "dart", "start": 8939, "end": 9053, "line": 217}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-9307", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-9307", "text": "'The highest heart rate held so far sits well below what your age '\n'predicts, so it reads as an effort that was never maximal rather '\n'than as your ceiling — the zones stay on the age estimate until the '\n'band sees a harder one.'", "sha256": "ea622521e4f164ea44d8ba457e26eab221ffcf9fe4b8313a5d3b3f8d07d4c8fd", "kind": "dart", "start": 9307, "end": 9569, "line": 223}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-9598", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-9598", "text": "'Not enough nights of resting heart rate behind the reserve yet.'", "sha256": "c1e829d6414766849658f94823681fcb282b7bfb0e5742539274bbff4a0df0cc", "kind": "dart", "start": 9598, "end": 9663, "line": 228}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-9689", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-9689", "text": "'You have set your zones manually, so there is no measured reserve '\n'anchor to plot a distribution against.'", "sha256": "fccf0085c2e20485d51ba45c718ca8c63f75d0cfa2eb816f962b295b2ea42a9b", "kind": "dart", "start": 9689, "end": 9808, "line": 230}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-9830", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-9830", "text": "'Too few recorded sessions to describe a pattern rather than noise.'", "sha256": "353da70b30b0891084694035aed79df0f228d6449dc209d1b89e1c73dbcae36b", "kind": "dart", "start": 9830, "end": 9898, "line": 233}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-11018", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-11018", "text": "'$why There were ${c[1]}, and it needs ${c[2]}.'", "sha256": "8fb24c818207d877170f5af2df893edf36e871b770d685262e6be00100b2fc22", "kind": "dart", "start": 11018, "end": 11066, "line": 255}
{"id": "lib/models/metric.dart:offset-11130", "file": "lib/models/metric.dart", "location": "offset-11130", "text": "'These recordings are not stamped with which strap made them, and '\n'this number has to be calibrated per strap, so it is withheld rather '\n'than guessed.'", "sha256": "744a7ff6b38f40745dd4af9a2d99f458b50cbef5791dc8c37c5ee95bac3a1b90", "kind": "dart", "start": 11130, "end": 11301, "line": 258}
